    {
      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5260293700088511294\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29B94.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e⛔️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The UK government wants to ban social media for children under 16.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBut banning social media for kids only puts them in greater danger.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThey will be pushed to use VPNs — and unlock far worse illegal content.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eWe’ve seen this before.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eWhen the Russian government banned Telegram, 95% of Russian teenagers kept using it. They just moved to VPNs. Same in Iran.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eParents already have the tools to restrict their kids’ digital habits: parental controls, screen-time limits — or no smartphone at all.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5307819226910700816\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A6E2808DE29982.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🤦‍♂️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Instead, many parents give toddlers iPads just to keep them quiet.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eNo amount of government regulation will fix that.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eUnder the new law, all social media users in the UK will have to “prove” they’re over 16 — with an ID, face scan or bank card.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5395695537687123235\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA8.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🚨\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Thousands in the UK are already arrested for political posts every year. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eIs this really about protecting children — or identifying more people to arrest?\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003eP. S. More about digital freedom in \u003c/i\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Yq_5aDdJ24\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003e\u003ci\u003emy speech\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ci\u003e — the source material for our \u003cb\u003e$200,000\u003c/b\u003e \u003c/i\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://t.me/contest/456\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eclipping contest\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ci\u003e.\u003c/i\u003e",
      "date": "2026-06-15T18:58:13Z",
